<title>SWEDEN: Assidoman 9 mo profit falls 52 pct.</title>
<headline>Assidoman 9 mo profit falls 52 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish forestry groupo AssiDoman reports for the nine months ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items		  1,620 vs  3,409</p>
<p> Turnover				   14,738 vs 16,648</p>
<p> Earnings per share (SKR)		10.15 vs  21.30</p>
<p> Operating costs			  12,160 vs 12,374</p>
<p> Profit pre deprec			 2,578 vs  4,274</p>
<p> Depreciation				  863 vs    768</p>
<p> Associate interests		  CHARGE 9 vs     34 CREDIT</p>
<p> Profit post deprec			1,706 vs  3,540</p>
<p> Net financial items		 CHARGE 86 vs    131 CHARGE</p>
<p> Tax					     416 vs    886</p>
<p> Minorities				    nil vs    nil</p>
<p> Net profit				  1,204 vs  2,523</p>
<p>NOTE -- Full company name is AssiDoman AB.</p>
<p>A Reuter poll of 13 analysts found an average forecast for a profit after financial items of 1.62 billion crowns.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-7001017</p>
</text>
